== Trivia ==
*After speaking to '''Hornum''', or one of the others in the [[Dwarven Tavern|tavern]], typing "burp" in public chat will cause '''Hornum''' to reward the player with a {{ItemDisplay|Dwarven Tankard}}.
**Typing party chat, guild chat, or private chat will not work.

